        1791,
        1850
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Last year, 72,729 people attended the game. This set a new record in baseball attendance at a benefit game. The net available for distribution was $91,298.33. We anticipate another heavy demand for tickets. I ask you to notify the employees of your department that reserved seats will go on sale in Room 1, City Hall, (Col. Edward G. Riekert's office) June 20. This location has been chosen largely for their convenience.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3126,
          "min": -1.5904
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
